title: $:/westhane/type-functions
tags: $:/tags/Global
code-body: yes

<!-- Type helpers. A type is a tiddler tagged Type. Subtypes name their
     supertype in parent (District -> Place). A content tiddler carries one
     type tag; status tags (Incomplete, Inactive, Minor) are not tagged Type
     and are ignored here. Needs $:/westhane/path-functions. -->

\function type.kind(node) [<node>tags[]tag[Type]first[]]
\function type.of(node) [<node>tags[]tag[Type]] :map:flat[function[path.chain],<currentTiddler>] +[unique[]]
\function type.root(node) [function[type.of],<node>last[]]
\function type.is(node,type) [function[type.of],<node>match<type>]
\function type.members(type) [<type>] [function[path.under],<type>] +[tag[Type]tagging[]]
